(&quot;/assets/uploads/admin/m-birth-011-20260909070742.jpg&quot;); background-position: 50% 50%; background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat;" data-editor-type="slide" data-editor-id="slide-r7cnwkoj-mttrmzx1" data-slide-order="2" data-editor-parent="slider-044rx5ji-msbjogqm"></span><span class="slide slide-3" data-editor-type="slide" data-editor-id="slide-nu9weupw-msbjogqo" data-slide-order="3" data-media="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/assets/optimized/upscaled-img-2/1920.avif&quot;,&quot;poster&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;muted&quot;:true,&quot;loop&quot;:true,&quot;playsInline&quot;:true,&quot;controls&quot;:false,&quot;fit&quot;:&quot;cover&quot;,&quot;focalPoint&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0.5,&quot;y&quot;:0.5},&quot;overlay&quot;:{}}" data-media-type="image" data-media-src="/assets/optimized/upscaled-img-2/1920.avif" data-poster="" data-focal-x="0.5" data-focal-y="0.5" data-editor-parent="slider-044rx5ji-msbjogqm" style="--media-position: 50% 50%; --media-fit: cover; background-image: url(&quot;/assets/optimized/upscaled-img-2/1920.avif&quot;); background-position: 50% 50%; background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat;"></span><span class="slide slide-1" data-media="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/assets/uploads/admin/river-boat-009-20260910103250.jpg&quot;,&quot;poster&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;muted&quot;:true,&quot;loop&quot;:true,&quot;playsInline&quot;:true,&quot;controls&quot;:false,&quot;fit&quot;:&quot;cover&quot;,&quot;focalPoint&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0.5,&quot;y&quot;:0.5},&quot;overlay&quot;:{}}" data-media-type="image" data-media-src="/assets/uploads/admin/river-boat-009-20260910103250.jpg" data-poster="" data-focal-x="0.5" data-focal-y="0.5" style="--media-position: 50% 50%; --media-fit: cover; background-image: url(&quot;/assets/uploads/admin/river-boat-009-20260910103250.jpg&quot;); background-position: 50% 50%; background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat;" data-editor-type="slide" data-editor-id="slide-37vh78al-mtve2odu" data-slide-order="4" data-editor-parent="slider-044rx5ji-msbjogqm"></span></div><div class="container hero-inner" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="section-ac4mifdo-msbjogqk"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-owegf49z-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm"></p><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-s826nfe1-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm">The Riverside Bar &amp; Restaurant</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-gpgbj4kr-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm"></p><h1 class="" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-dmxluavj-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm">Chiang Mai Nights Begin By The River</h1><p class="hero-copy" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-0dodv1jf-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm">For more than 40 years, The Riverside has brought together riverfront dining, nightly live music, relaxed drinks, memorable celebrations, and Chiang Mai’s most accessible dinner cruise.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" data-track="cruise_booking_click" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-9hiamvn9-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm" href="/river-cruises#booking">Book a River Cruise</a><a class="btn secondary" data-track="music_schedule_view" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-larvw5wg-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm" href="/where-we-rock#tonight">See Tonight’s Music</a><a class="btn secondary" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-1m8w9ow5-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm" href="#experiences">Explore Riverside</a></div></div><aside class="hero-card"><strong class="" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ui1redm6-msbjogqm" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm">Quick facts</strong><div class="fact-list r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-i4t11b57-msbjogqo" data-editor-parent="container-761lhl0w-msbjogqm"><span data-layout-id="layout-ttlpci7o-mryxqg33" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-37mbbvw7-msbjogql" data-editor-parent="page">Since 1984</span><span data-layout-id="layout-kta3wcuv-mryxqg34" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 12;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-lvqmoxm3-msbjogql" data-editor-parent="page">Live Music Nightly</span><span data-layout-id="layout-7oiti5vb-mryxqg34" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 2; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 2; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 24;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-4zgzzhv5-msbjogql" data-editor-parent="page">90-Minute River Cruises</span><span data-layout-id="layout-ktsqfxkc-mryxqg34" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 3; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 3; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 3; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 36;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-orl7fhry-msbjogql" data-editor-parent="page">Open 7 Days a Week</span></div></aside></div></section>

<section class="section is-editor-selected" id="experiences" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-1h4rs5mx-msbjogqo" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-ab7s0q97-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="section-1h4rs5mx-msbjogqo"><div class="section-head"><h2 class="" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-qn48j169-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="container-ab7s0q97-msbjogqp">Choose your Riverside experience</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-c4ybrtcs-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="container-ab7s0q97-msbjogqp">Come for one reason or stay for the whole night: cruise, dinner, conversation, music, drinks, and celebrations all happen in one riverside destination.</p></div><div class="experience-cards r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-vzuhn5ro-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="container-ab7s0q97-msbjogqp">
        <a class="image-card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-6p134811-mryxqg39" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-6m1my782-msbjogqo" data-editor-parent="page" href="/river-cruises"><picture data-editor-type="image" data-editor-id="admin-image-w0zkpow" data-editor-parent="item-6m1my782-msbjogqo"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/480.avif 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/768.avif 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1024.avif 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1440.avif 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1920.avif 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/2560.avif 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/3840.avif 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/480.webp 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/768.webp 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1024.webp 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1440.webp 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1920.webp 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/2560.webp 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/3840.webp 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><img src="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-dsc01829/1440.jpg" alt="Ping River dinner cruise" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><span data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-m8ph3a1t-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="item-6m1my782-msbjogqo">River Cruises</span><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-g51cylvc-msbjogqp" data-editor-parent="item-6m1my782-msbjogqo">90 minutes on the Ping River from just ฿200 per person.</p></a>
