<section class="section dark river-feature" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-70xzhtbu-msbjogqq" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container feature-grid" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="section-70xzhtbu-msbjogqq"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-pp1mih9a-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr">Featured River Cruise</p><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-o9v87v7a-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" class="">Dinner on the Ping River for Just 200THB</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-uyo7p4qy-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" class="">Step aboard for a relaxed 90-minute journey along the Ping River. Choose your meal from The Riverside menu, enjoy food served during the cruise, and order beer or drinks from the onboard bar.</p><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-eoxqudbl-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" class="">One of Chiang Mai’s most affordable ways to enjoy food and drinks on the Ping River.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" data-track="cruise_booking_click" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-aofat95l-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" href="/river-cruises#booking">Reserve Cruise Seats</a><a class="btn secondary" data-track="private_boat_inquiry_click" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-jpditdw2-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" href="/events#booking">Ask About a Private Boat</a><a class="text-link light" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-xs43ydbc-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr" href="/river-cruises">View Cruise Details</a></div></div><div class="price-card"><b>฿200</b><span>per person</span><ul class="r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-0tid3ykv-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="container-ga3oy4s8-msbjogqr"><li data-layout-id="layout-9p1zrpfj-mryxqg3e" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-m4urt5f8-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page">90-minute cruise</li><li data-layout-id="layout-6oohdvzf-mryxqg3e" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 12;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-vflxmtxj-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page">Two boats</li><li data-layout-id="layout-q70ic67t-mryxqg3e" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 2; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 2; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 24;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-dr72gzpz-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page">About 40 to 50 guests per boat</li><li data-layout-id="layout-icl9d3wr-mryxqg3e" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 3; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 3; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 3; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 36;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-3k8p2fc9-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page">Food and drinks ordered separately</li><li data-layout-id="layout-x0f57e50-mryxqg3e" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:4,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:4,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:4,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 4; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 4; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 4; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 48;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-vjpu20tz-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page">Individuals and group reservations welcome</li></ul></div></div></section>

<section class="section" id="tonight" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-rqr0yhe8-msbjogqr" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-0nqe632f-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="section-rqr0yhe8-msbjogqr"><div class="section-head"><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-7zluxzbu-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="container-0nqe632f-msbjogqt">Live Music, Every Night.</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-e3314l1c-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="container-0nqe632f-msbjogqt">From 8 PM until late, Riverside moves through a rotating lineup of singers, bands, pop, rock, international favorites, and special jam sessions. Come for dinner, stay for the music, or join the evening when the room comes alive.</p></div><div class="schedule-panel r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-np0f2qan-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="container-0nqe632f-msbjogqt"><div data-layout-id="layout-cgye8yq9-mryxqg3h" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-lx087vz2-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="grid-np0f2qan-msbjogqt"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-xqomkaem-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-lx087vz2-msbjogqs">Tonight’s performers</h3><p class="muted" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-4rvt6btz-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-lx087vz2-msbjogqs">The performer list is updated by staff. Call Riverside or check the live music page before you arrive.</p><a class="btn primary" data-track="music_schedule_view" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-bh7boasx-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-lx087vz2-msbjogqs" href="/where-we-rock#tonight">View Music Schedule</a></div><div data-layout-id="layout-n490ukbq-mryxqg3h" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:4,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 4; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 4;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-mf1jm0qd-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="grid-np0f2qan-msbjogqt"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-tunfx34w-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-mf1jm0qd-msbjogqs">Music hours</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-wm2b0q2u-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-mf1jm0qd-msbjogqs">Music begins at 8:00 PM and continues until approximately 1:00 AM. A new artist or band may perform each hour.</p></div><div data-layout-id="layout-lcn20e3e-mryxqg3h" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 8; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 8;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-hfhfhppj-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="grid-np0f2qan-msbjogqt"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ahq5gmx1-msbjogqs" data-editor-parent="item-hfhfhppj-msbjogqs">Jam sessions</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-nyf05pl1-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="item-hfhfhppj-msbjogqs">Selected nights include public jam sessions. Staff can confirm tonight’s format.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section alt" id="atmospheres" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-6yxubgdm-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-b3t7isgj-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="section-6yxubgdm-msbjogqt"><div class="section-head"><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-mt7z0nnx-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="container-b3t7isgj-msbjogqu">One Riverside. Three Ways to Spend the Evening.</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-97403tqn-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-b3t7isgj-msbjogqu">Choose the energy that fits the night, from close-up music to river conversation to a calmer upstairs drink.</p></div><div class="atmosphere-grid r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-9a9bjb1c-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-b3t7isgj-msbjogqu">
  <article data-layout-id="layout-o56sbfxp-mryxqg3i" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-6cwkxjbf-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="grid-9a9bjb1c-msbjogqu"><picture data-editor-type="image" data-editor-id="admin-image-zy0uzd1" data-editor-parent="item-6cwkxjbf-msbjogqt"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/480.avif 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/768.avif 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1024.avif 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1440.avif 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1920.avif 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/2560.avif 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/3840.avif 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/480.webp 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/768.webp 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1024.webp 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1440.webp 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1920.webp 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/2560.webp 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/3840.webp 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><img src="/assets/optimized/for-web-band-adawn-dsc00411/1440.jpg" alt="Live music room at Riverside" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-jl9synkd-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-6cwkxjbf-msbjogqt">Main Music Room</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-pzak3lck-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-6cwkxjbf-msbjogqt">High-energy seating near the performers, bar, and late-night atmosphere. Best for guests who want dinner to lead straight into music and drinks.</p></article>
  <article data-layout-id="layout-lmlmkwyi-mryxqg3i" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:4,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 4; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 4;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-nyfkxx83-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="grid-9a9bjb1c-msbjogqu"><img src="/assets/for-web/cruise/dsc06595.jpg" alt="Riverside dining terrace" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-e50xqxxt-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-nyfkxx83-msbjogqt">Riverside Terrace</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-xi9f8k7v-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-nyfkxx83-msbjogqt">Open-air seating by the Ping River. You can still hear the music while keeping conversation easy over food and drinks.</p></article>
  <article data-layout-id="layout-43se8k87-mryxqg3i" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 8; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 8;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-5tkz1eo0-msbjogqt" data-editor-parent="grid-9a9bjb1c-msbjogqu"><picture data-editor-type="image" data-editor-id="admin-image-r5v38ux" data-editor-parent="item-5tkz1eo0-msbjogqt"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/480.avif 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/768.avif 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1024.avif 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1440.avif 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1920.avif 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/2560.avif 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/3840.avif 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/480.webp 480w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/768.webp 768w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1024.webp 1024w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1440.webp 1440w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1920.webp 1920w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/2560.webp 2560w, /assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/3840.webp 3840w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, (max-width: 1050px) 50vw, 33vw"><img src="/assets/optimized/for-web-cruise-img-9533/1440.jpg" alt="Quiet upstairs lounge atmosphere" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-7k4xfduo-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-5tkz1eo0-msbjogqt">Upstairs Lounge</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-7hd1z854-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="item-5tkz1eo0-msbjogqt">A quieter bar and conversation space above the energy, with more privacy while still feeling part of the night.</p></article>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section lounge-video-section" aria-label="Riverside upstairs lounge atmosphere" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-ozk7cag0-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64">
  <video class="section-bg-video" autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" poster="/assets/lounge/IMG_6723.jpg" data-ping-pong-video="true">
    <source src="/assets/lounge/IMG_6730.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="container lounge-video-copy" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="section-ozk7cag0-msbjogqu">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-1fv338t6-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu">Upstairs Lounge</p>
    <h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-wv6ckg9o-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu">Find a quieter corner above the night.</h2>
    <p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-gfgoy6bf-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu">Settle into the upper room for drinks, conversation, and a little distance from the main floor while the evening keeps moving below.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" data-track="group_inquiry_submit" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-3h47uxoh-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu" href="/events#booking">Ask About the Lounge</a><a class="btn secondary" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-l3zjv1m8-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="container-vpl034kl-msbjogqu" href="/wine-and-dine">See Dining</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-xu96awap-msbjogqu" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-gbvn7v71-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="section-xu96awap-msbjogqu"><div class="section-head"><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-roif59x1-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="container-gbvn7v71-msbjogqv">Thai Flavor, Western Favorites, Riverside Hospitality.</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-bu8htmow-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="container-gbvn7v71-msbjogqv">Our kitchen brings together authentic Thai cooking, familiar Western dishes, shareable plates, and full meals. Ingredients are sourced locally whenever possible, and every table is served with the warmth and care of a team rooted in the Chiang Mai community.</p></div><div class="cards r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="container-gbvn7v71-msbjogqv"><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-4wxs0x69-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-1b62ebdl-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-80a8t80g-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-1b62ebdl-msbjogqv">Authentic Thai dishes</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-unom1jqy-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-1b62ebdl-msbjogqv">Local flavor for riverfront dinners and shared tables.</p></article><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-vnaxv464-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:4,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 4; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 4;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-vv6aspmp-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-q5x772us-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-vv6aspmp-msbjogqv">Western favorites</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-o05o3zzv-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-vv6aspmp-msbjogqv">Comfortable options for travelers, families, and mixed groups.</p></article><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-644tfk21-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 8; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 8;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-ljmv2xhc-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-4fr6azdb-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-ljmv2xhc-msbjogqv">Finger food and plates</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-pu694dau-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-ljmv2xhc-msbjogqv">Light bites, full meals, and food that fits drinks and music.</p></article><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-um3l2i4t-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:3,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 3; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 12;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-vkcrc1nj-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-njwbonjj-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-vkcrc1nj-msbjogqv">Hand-cut fries</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-75jm65lp-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-vkcrc1nj-msbjogqv">A Riverside signature made with carefully selected potatoes.</p></article><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-wutc5tjz-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:4,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:4,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 4; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 2; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 4; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 16;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-yopqi0hm-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-40boxurg-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-yopqi0hm-msbjogqv">Monthly specials</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-2v9wrl3s-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-yopqi0hm-msbjogqv">Food and drink specials can be updated by staff.</p></article><article class="card r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-7pmr4gml-mryxqg3k" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:5,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 8; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 2; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 5; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 20;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-p64wdjsz-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="grid-eba17plj-msbjogqv"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-v64xzwrc-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-p64wdjsz-msbjogqv">Fast, friendly service</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-094njqas-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="item-p64wdjsz-msbjogqv">Local hospitality for dinner, groups, cruises, and late nights.</p></article></div></div></section>

<section class="section dark" id="discover-riverside-section" data-riverside-prototype="discover" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-0ab6rajf-msbjogqv" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container feature-grid" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="section-0ab6rajf-msbjogqv"><div class="riverside-editor-canvas" data-canvas-id="discover-riverside-section" data-riverside-hydrated-defaults="1"><div class="riverside-canvas-item" data-riverside-canvas-item="discover-heading" data-parent-section-id="discover-riverside-section" data-frame="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:560,&quot;y&quot;:88,&quot;width&quot;:520,&quot;height&quot;:88}}" data-mobile="{&quot;mode&quot;:&quot;flow&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:1}" style="left: 560px; top: 88px; width: 520px; min-height: 88px;" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ezf8r0n5-mtinbsoe" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">Discover Riverside</div><div class="riverside-canvas-item" data-riverside-canvas-item="discover-body" data-parent-section-id="discover-riverside-section" data-frame="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:560,&quot;y&quot;:208,&quot;width&quot;:520,&quot;height&quot;:184}}" data-mobile="{&quot;mode&quot;:&quot;flow&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:2}" style="left: 560px; top: 208px; width: 520px; min-height: 184px;" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-c17xdinc-mtinbsoe" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">Take a step into intimate dinners, live music, and scenic river cruises. The Riverside offers the Chiang Mai adventure for every occasion. Exceptional food, warm staff, and beautiful surroundings are a perfect setting for memorable gatherings with energetic vibes.</div><div class="riverside-canvas-item" data-riverside-canvas-item="discover-tagline" data-parent-section-id="discover-riverside-section" data-frame="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:184,&quot;y&quot;:424,&quot;width&quot;:304,&quot;height&quot;:64}}" data-mobile="{&quot;mode&quot;:&quot;flow&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:3}" style="left: 184px; top: 424px; width: 304px; min-height: 64px;" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-7wwrakyp-mtinbsoe" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">A treasure for any taste.</div></div><div><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-8jde48ek-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">Bring the Group. We’ll Help Shape the Evening.</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ue1f5wyh-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">Riverside can host business groups, tour groups, birthdays, friends, family gatherings, private celebrations, corporate events, full-boat reservations, and covered or private areas.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" data-track="group_inquiry_submit" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-qny6qt6p-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw" href="/events#booking">Plan a Group Dinner</a><a class="btn secondary" data-track="private_boat_inquiry_click" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-17h6mlgk-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw" href="/events#booking">Reserve a Private Cruise</a><a class="text-link light" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-k5oe1xvu-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw" href="/events">Ask About Events</a></div></div><form class="inquiry-form" data-inquiry-form="" data-context="homepage-groups" id="booking">
  <div class="form-grid"><label>Name<input name="name" required="" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required="" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Phone or WhatsApp<input name="phone" autocomplete="tel"></label><label>Preferred date<input name="preferredDate" type="date"></label><label>Preferred time<input name="preferredTime" type="time"></label><label>Group size<input name="groupSize" type="number" min="1"></label><label>Event type<select name="eventType"><option>River cruise</option><option>Private boat</option><option>Group dinner</option><option>Birthday</option><option>Corporate event</option><option>Tour group</option><option>Family gathering</option><option>Table reservation</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Preferred area<select name="preferredArea"><option>Undecided</option><option>Boat</option><option>Restaurant</option><option>Riverside Terrace</option><option>Upstairs Lounge</option><option>Main Music Room</option></select></label></div>
  <label>Food and beverage requirements<textarea name="foodBeverage" rows="3"></textarea></label>
  <label>Additional notes<textarea name="notes" rows="4"></textarea></label>
  <button class="btn primary" type="submit" data-track="group_inquiry_submit" data-editor-type="link" data-editor-id="link-5kgncz0o-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="container-ff4lg6sd-msbjogqw">Send inquiry</button><p class="form-status" role="status"></p>
</form></div></section>

<section class="section alt" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-9uccifkb-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-b0gbm1ya-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="section-9uccifkb-msbjogqw"><div class="section-head"><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-97l7yqxa-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="container-b0gbm1ya-msbjogqx">Part of Chiang Mai Nights Since 1984.</h2><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ljniazrm-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="container-b0gbm1ya-msbjogqx">Established in 1984 on the Ping River, Riverside has welcomed generations of guests for dining, music, nightlife, river cruises, and celebrations.</p></div><div class="stat-stack horizontal r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-nrjurxd5-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="container-b0gbm1ya-msbjogqx"><div class="stat r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-kmppc9n9-mryxqg3n" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-wr0wpxou-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="grid-nrjurxd5-msbjogqx"><b data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-tu6mo9ar-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-wr0wpxou-msbjogqw">1984</b><span data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-pe5ytk0g-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-wr0wpxou-msbjogqw">Established in Chiang Mai</span></div><div class="stat r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-s277v73g-mryxqg3n" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:4,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 4; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 6; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 4;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-ho7otb8w-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="grid-nrjurxd5-msbjogqx"><b data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-c2iou084-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-ho7otb8w-msbjogqw">Ping River</b><span data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-fbm3z6rd-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-ho7otb8w-msbjogqw">Longstanding Charoenrat Road location</span></div><div class="stat r-grid-item" data-layout-id="layout-d6ppngcm-mryxqg3n" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:4,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:6,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 8; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 4; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 6; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 8;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-1e5ju5wo-msbjogqw" data-editor-parent="grid-nrjurxd5-msbjogqx"><b data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-p80obg79-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-1e5ju5wo-msbjogqw">Generations</b><span data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-st1d40yf-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-1e5ju5wo-msbjogqw">Dinner, music, nightlife, and celebrations</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section" data-bg-type="inherit" data-editor-type="section" data-editor-id="section-k452bwoo-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="page-h60bhf9r-mtvdzp64"><div class="container contact-panel" data-editor-type="container" data-editor-id="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy" data-editor-parent="section-k452bwoo-msbjogqx"><div><h2 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-ohrpfmkq-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy">Practical Information</h2><div class="contact-list r-layout-grid" data-editor-type="grid" data-editor-id="grid-306n4ua2-msbjogqy" data-editor-parent="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy"><span data-layout-id="layout-bafadh5v-mryxqg3o" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 0; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 0; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 0; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 0;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-zojcbcqb-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="grid-306n4ua2-msbjogqy"><strong data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-fksfj9gg-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-zojcbcqb-msbjogqx">Hours</strong><br>Open 7 Days a Week. Current hours are maintained on Google Maps.</span><span data-layout-id="layout-ywc75ee4-mryxqg3o" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 1; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 1; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 1; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 12;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-3d6xwa94-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="grid-306n4ua2-msbjogqy"><strong data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-dtzr165w-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-3d6xwa94-msbjogqx">Parking</strong><br>Secure complimentary parking across the street in a guarded lot.</span><span data-layout-id="layout-xjxnwtcf-mryxqg3o" class="r-grid-item" data-layout="{&quot;desktop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;tablet&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;mobile&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:2,&quot;w&quot;:12,&quot;h&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;}}" style="--r-desktop-x: 0; --r-desktop-y: 2; --r-desktop-w: 12; --r-tablet-x: 0; --r-tablet-y: 2; --r-tablet-w: 12; --r-mobile-x: 0; --r-mobile-y: 2; --r-mobile-w: 12; order: 24;" data-editor-type="card" data-editor-id="item-hyrhqr38-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="grid-306n4ua2-msbjogqy"><strong data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-50j8zaxo-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="item-hyrhqr38-msbjogqx">Address</strong><br>The Riverside Bar &amp; Restaurant, 9-11 Charoenrat Road, Tambon Chang Moi, Mueang Chiang Mai District, Chiang Mai 50000, Thailand</span></div></div><div class="map-card"><h3 data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-a3rxpesv-msbjogqx" data-editor-parent="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy">Directions, hours, and reviews</h3><p data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-p87rwdf6-msbjogqy" data-editor-parent="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy">Use the live Google Maps listing for current hours, guest photos, directions, and reviews.</p><a class="btn primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="directions_click" data-editor-type="text" data-editor-id="text-867ru61x-msbjogqy" data-editor-parent="container-y3ggenop-msbjogqy" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/MYttm9RpW27f8QUr9">Open Google Maps</a></div></div></section>
      
    </main>
