    <aside class="concierge site-assistant" aria-label="Riverside digital assistant" data-shell-control="assistant-trigger">
      <button class="concierge-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open Riverside digital assistant" title="Open Riverside digital assistant" data-track="concierge_conversation"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3a7 7 0 0 0-7 7v3a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h.5l2.5 3 2.5-3h.5a4 4 0 0 0 4-4v-3a7 7 0 0 0-7-7Z"/><path d="M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M9 14h6"/></svg></button>
      <div class="concierge-panel assistant-panel" hidden>
        <div class="concierge-head"><strong>Riverside Digital Assistant</strong><button type="button" aria-label="Close assistant">Close</button></div>
        <p class="assistant-intro">I can help with Riverside cruises, dinner, music, parking, groups, and choosing the right area.</p>
        <div class="assistant-log" aria-live="polite"><div class="assistant-message assistant-message-assistant"><p>Hi, I’m Riverside’s digital host. Ask a question, or tap a quick answer below.</p></div></div>
        <div class="chat-suggestions" aria-label="Suggested questions">
          <button type="button" data-answer="The river cruise is ฿200 per person for a relaxed 90-minute trip on the Ping River. Food and drinks are ordered separately unless staff confirms otherwise." data-sources="[{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;River Cruises&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/river-cruises&quot;}]">Cruise price</button>
          <button type="button" data-answer="Live music begins at 8:00 PM and continues until approximately 1:00 AM. The exact performer list should be confirmed by Riverside staff." data-sources="[{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Live Music&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/where-we-rock&quot;}]">Music tonight</button>
          <button type="button" data-answer="The searchable Riverside menu is available at /menu with food, drinks, printed prices, vegetarian items, spicy dishes, beer, wine, cocktails, and source PDF references. Staff should confirm current availability." data-sources="[{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Menu&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/menu&quot;}]">Menu</button>
          <button type="button" data-answer="Riverside has secure complimentary parking across the street. Use the Contact page for directions, phone, email, and the Google Maps listing." data-sources="[{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Contact & Directions&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/contact&quot;}]">Parking</button>
        </div>
        <form class="assistant-form" data-assistant-form>
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="assistant-question">Ask Riverside</label>
          <input id="assistant-question" name="question" placeholder="Type a question..." autocomplete="off" />
          <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send</button>
        </form>
        <details class="assistant-escalation"><summary>Ask staff to follow up</summary><form class="concierge-form" data-inquiry-form data-context="concierge">
          <input name="name" placeholder="Name" autocomplete="name" />
          <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" />
          <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone or WhatsApp" autocomplete="tel" />
          <textarea name="notes" placeholder="Reservation, group, or event details"></textarea>
          <input type="hidden" name="eventType" value="Digital assistant follow-up" />
          <button class="btn secondary dark-text" type="submit">Send to staff</button>
          <p class="form-status" role="status"></p>
        </form></details>
      </div>
    </aside>
